      <div type="clause" n="56">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 56</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{C} Gif mon hwelcne ceap gebygð ⁊ he ðonne onfinde him hwelce unhælo on binnan XXX nihta, þonne weorpe þone ceap to honda; oððe swerie, þæt he him mnan facn on nyste, þa he hine him sealde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone buys any property and within thirty days he finds some flaw in it, then he should return the property to the hands [of the seller]; or [the seller] must swear that he knew of no defect when he sold it to him.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone buys any sort of beast, and then finds any manner of blemish in it within thirty days, he shall send it back to [its former] owner... or [the former owner] shall swear that he knew of no blemish in it when he sold it him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon hwylcne ceap gebygeþ ⁊ he ðonne onfinde him hwylce unhælo binnon XXX nihta, þonne weorpe he ðone ceap to handa; oþþe swerige, þæt he him nan facen on nyste, þa he hine him sealde.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
